ssets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/c6f999dd10441ade6684424f042ff8cd.webp?t=1774491928\" width=388 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a run breaks, the clock drags you back to the Chamber of Time. New perks, battle cards, enemies, and Soulwords keep reshaping each attempt, forcing you to adapt, experiment, and push deeper into Grim\u2019s world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/4b0ad81b67de54ab8f1faf18fd3e2ffb.avif?t=1774491928\" width=1165 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/c3e7f29fb331fccb5a813f1a1b09a918.poster.avif?t=1774491928\" width=608 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/c3e7f29fb331fccb5a813f1a1b09a918.webm?t=1774491928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/c3e7f29fb331fccb5a813f1a1b09a918.mp4?t=1774491928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Fun Fact: Every piece of the game/card Art was designed and hand painted by the developer over 5 years</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/539912b1fbee31ccf5293314d4bc18b2.avif?t=1774491928\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras_big/539912b1fbee31ccf5293314d4bc18b2.avif?t=1774491928 width=1560 height=674 /></span><strong> </strong><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content notice:</strong> themes of death, grief, mild horror.</p>","d